  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2302.39 “Scheduled completion date” means the date stated in the original loan agreement, initial loan documents, or grant agreement on which the construction project that received CMF funds is intended to be placed into use for the purposes for which it was intended.\n\nSource. #13858, INTERIM, eff 1-27-24, EXPIRED: 7-25-24\n\nNew. #14078, eff 9-24-24",
